{"seq":1,"slug":"window-functions","title":"窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/window-functions","wordCount":728,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"窗口函数\">窗口函数</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>窗口函数</strong>（Window Function）在一组相关的行（&quot;窗口&quot;）上做计算，但与聚合函数不同——它不会把多行折叠为一行，而是为每一行都返回一个结果。其行为由 <code>OVER</code> 子句定义：<code>PARTITION BY</code> 划分窗口分区，<code>ORDER BY</code> 决定分区内顺序，帧规范限定当前行的计算范围。SQLite 自 3.25.0 起支持窗口函数。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是窗口函数\">什么是窗口函数</h2><p><strong>窗口函数</strong>（Window Function）是一类在结果集的&quot;窗口&quot;上进行计算的函数。与聚合函数不同，窗口函数不会将多行合并为一行，而是为每行返回一个计算结果。SQLite 从 3.25.0 版本开始支持窗口函数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 聚合函数&#10;        INPUT1[多行输入] --&gt; AGG[SUM/COUNT/AVG] --&gt; OUTPUT1[单行输出]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 窗口函数&#10;        INPUT2[多行输入] --&gt; WIN[SUM/COUNT OVER ...] --&gt; OUTPUT2[每行一个输出]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 聚合函数\n        INPUT1[多行输入] --&gt; AGG[SUM/COUNT/AVG] --&gt; OUTPUT1[单行输出]\n    end\n    subgraph 窗口函数\n        INPUT2[多行输入] --&gt; WIN[SUM/COUNT OVER ...] --&gt; OUTPUT2[每行一个输出]\n    end</pre><p>窗口函数的基本语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"function_name() OVER (&#10;    [PARTITION BY column_list]&#10;    [ORDER BY column_list]&#10;    [frame_specification]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">function_name() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [PARTITION BY column_list]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [ORDER BY column_list]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [frame_specification]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子句</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>是否必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PARTITION BY</td>\n<td>将结果集分组为独立的窗口分区</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORDER BY</td>\n<td>定义每个分区内行的排列顺序</td>\n<td>视函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>frame_spec</td>\n<td>定义当前行的计算范围（帧）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"排名函数\">排名函数</h2><p>排名函数用于为分区内的行分配序号或排名。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE exam_scores (&#10;    student TEXT,&#10;    subject TEXT,&#10;    score   INTEGER&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO exam_scores VALUES&#10;(&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;数学&#39;, 95), (&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;英语&#39;, 88),&#10;(&#39;Bob&#39;, &#39;数学&#39;, 92),   (&#39;Bob&#39;, &#39;英语&#39;, 95),&#10;(&#39;Carol&#39;, &#39;数学&#39;, 95), (&#39;Carol&#39;, &#39;英语&#39;, 82),&#10;(&#39;Dave&#39;, &#39;数学&#39;, 88),  (&#39;Dave&#39;, &#39;英语&#39;, 90);&#10;&#10;SELECT&#10;    student,&#10;    subject,&#10;    score,&#10;    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY subject ORDER BY score DESC) AS row_num,&#10;    RANK()       OVER (PARTITION BY subject ORDER BY score DESC) AS rank_val,&#10;    DENSE_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY subject ORDER BY score DESC) AS dense_rank_val&#10;FROM exam_scores;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> exam_scores</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exam_scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数学'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'英语'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数学'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),   (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'英语'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Carol'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数学'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Carol'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'英语'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">82</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Dave'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数学'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Dave'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'英语'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row_num,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank_val,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    DENSE_RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dense_rank_val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exam_scores;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>并列处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROW_NUMBER()</td>\n<td>唯一递增序号</td>\n<td>不考虑并列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RANK()</td>\n<td>允许并列，跳过后续序号</td>\n<td>1, 1, 3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DENSE_RANK()</td>\n<td>允许并列，不跳过序号</td>\n<td>1, 1, 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTILE(n)</td>\n<td>将行均匀分为 n 组</td>\n<td>返回组号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- NTILE：将学生按成绩分为 3 档&#10;SELECT&#10;    student,&#10;    score,&#10;    NTILE(3) OVER (ORDER BY score DESC) AS tier&#10;FROM exam_scores&#10;WHERE subject = &#39;数学&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NTILE：将学生按成绩分为 3 档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    NTILE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exam_scores</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '数学'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"值访问函数\">值访问函数</h2><p><strong>LAG</strong> 和 <strong>LEAD</strong> 函数用于访问当前行之前或之后的行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE daily_sales (&#10;    sale_date TEXT,&#10;    amount    INTEGER&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO daily_sales VALUES&#10;(&#39;2026-01-01&#39;, 1000), (&#39;2026-01-02&#39;, 1200),&#10;(&#39;2026-01-03&#39;, 950),  (&#39;2026-01-04&#39;, 1500),&#10;(&#39;2026-01-05&#39;, 1100);&#10;&#10;SELECT&#10;    sale_date,&#10;    amount,&#10;    LAG(amount, 1, 0)  OVER (ORDER BY sale_date) AS prev_amount,&#10;    LEAD(amount, 1, 0) OVER (ORDER BY sale_date) AS next_amount,&#10;    amount - LAG(amount, 1, 0) OVER (ORDER BY sale_date) AS daily_change&#10;FROM daily_sales;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> daily_sales</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sale_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-01-02'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-01-03'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">950</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-01-04'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-01-05'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sale_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LEAD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_change</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LAG(expr, n, default)</td>\n<td>前第 n 行的值</td>\n<td>n 默认 1，default 可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LEAD(expr, n, default)</td>\n<td>后第 n 行的值</td>\n<td>n 默认 1，default 可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FIRST_VALUE(expr)</td>\n<td>窗口帧中第一行的值</td>\n<td>无额外参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LAST_VALUE(expr)</td>\n<td>窗口帧中最后一行的值</td>\n<td>无额外参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTH_VALUE(expr, n)</td>\n<td>窗口帧中第 n 行的值</td>\n<td>n 从 1 开始</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每个学科中的最高分和最低分&#10;SELECT&#10;    student,&#10;    subject,&#10;    score,&#10;    FIRST_VALUE(student) OVER w AS top_student,&#10;    LAST_VALUE(student)  OVER w AS bottom_student&#10;FROM exam_scores&#10;WINDOW w AS (&#10;    PARTITION BY subject&#10;    ORDER BY score DESC&#10;    RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每个学科中的最高分和最低分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    FIRST_VALUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(student) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top_student,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LAST_VALUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(student)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bottom_student</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exam_scores</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WINDOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOLLOWING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>LAST_VALUE</code> 的默认帧是从分区开始到当前行，而不是整个分区。如果需要整个分区的最后一个值，必须显式指定 <code>RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"聚合窗口函数\">聚合窗口函数</h2><p>所有聚合函数都可以作为窗口函数使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    sale_date,&#10;    amount,&#10;    SUM(amount)   OVER (ORDER BY sale_date) AS running_total,&#10;    AVG(amount)   OVER (ORDER BY sale_date) AS running_avg,&#10;    COUNT(*)      OVER (ORDER BY sale_date) AS running_count&#10;FROM daily_sales;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sale_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_avg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"帧规范\">帧规范</h2><p><strong>帧规范</strong>（Frame Specification）定义了窗口函数的精确计算范围。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    FRAME[帧规范]&#10;    FRAME --&gt; TYPE[帧类型]&#10;    FRAME --&gt; START_B[起始边界]&#10;    FRAME --&gt; END_B[终止边界]&#10;    TYPE --&gt; ROWS[ROWS&lt;br/&gt;物理行数]&#10;    TYPE --&gt; RANGE[RANGE&lt;br/&gt;逻辑值范围]&#10;    TYPE --&gt; GROUPS[GROUPS&lt;br/&gt;对等组]\">graph TD\n    FRAME[帧规范]\n    FRAME --&gt; TYPE[帧类型]\n    FRAME --&gt; START_B[起始边界]\n    FRAME --&gt; END_B[终止边界]\n    TYPE --&gt; ROWS[ROWS&lt;br/&gt;物理行数]\n    TYPE --&gt; RANGE[RANGE&lt;br/&gt;逻辑值范围]\n    TYPE --&gt; GROUPS[GROUPS&lt;br/&gt;对等组]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 语法&#10;frame_type BETWEEN frame_start AND frame_end&#10;&#10;-- frame_type: ROWS | RANGE | GROUPS&#10;-- frame_start / frame_end:&#10;--   UNBOUNDED PRECEDING&#10;--   N PRECEDING&#10;--   CURRENT ROW&#10;--   N FOLLOWING&#10;--   UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">frame_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frame_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frame_end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- frame_type: ROWS | RANGE | GROUPS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- frame_start / frame_end:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   UNBOUNDED PRECEDING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   N PRECEDING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   CURRENT ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   N FOLLOWING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 3 日移动平均&#10;SELECT&#10;    sale_date,&#10;    amount,&#10;    AVG(amount) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY sale_date&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND 1 FOLLOWING&#10;    ) AS moving_avg_3&#10;FROM daily_sales;&#10;&#10;-- 累计总和&#10;SELECT&#10;    sale_date,&#10;    amount,&#10;    SUM(amount) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY sale_date&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS cumulative_sum&#10;FROM daily_sales;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3 日移动平均</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sale_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOLLOWING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moving_avg_3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 累计总和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sale_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cumulative_sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>帧类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROWS</td>\n<td>以物理行为单位</td>\n<td>移动平均、滑动窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RANGE</td>\n<td>以值范围为单位</td>\n<td>同值行需一起计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GROUPS</td>\n<td>以对等组为单位</td>\n<td>按组滑动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"window-子句\">WINDOW 子句</h2><p>使用 <strong>WINDOW</strong> 子句可以定义命名窗口，避免重复编写相同的窗口规范：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    student,&#10;    subject,&#10;    score,&#10;    ROW_NUMBER() OVER w AS row_num,&#10;    RANK()       OVER w AS rank_val,&#10;    SUM(score)   OVER w AS running_sum&#10;FROM exam_scores&#10;WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY subject ORDER BY score DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row_num,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank_val,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_sum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exam_scores</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WINDOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((窗口函数))&#10;    排名函数&#10;      ROW_NUMBER&#10;      RANK&#10;      DENSE_RANK&#10;      NTILE&#10;    值访问函数&#10;      LAG / LEAD&#10;      FIRST_VALUE&#10;      LAST_VALUE&#10;      NTH_VALUE&#10;    聚合窗口&#10;      SUM OVER&#10;      AVG OVER&#10;      COUNT OVER&#10;    帧规范&#10;      ROWS&#10;      RANGE&#10;      GROUPS&#10;    命名窗口&#10;      WINDOW 子句\">mindmap\n  root((窗口函数))\n    排名函数\n      ROW_NUMBER\n      RANK\n      DENSE_RANK\n      NTILE\n    值访问函数\n      LAG / LEAD\n      FIRST_VALUE\n      LAST_VALUE\n      NTH_VALUE\n    聚合窗口\n      SUM OVER\n      AVG OVER\n      COUNT OVER\n    帧规范\n      ROWS\n      RANGE\n      GROUPS\n    命名窗口\n      WINDOW 子句</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>窗口函数</strong>在不合并行的情况下对结果集进行分析计算，SQLite 3.25+ 支持。</li>\n<li><strong>排名函数</strong>（ROW_NUMBER、RANK、DENSE_RANK）用于为分区内的行分配序号。</li>\n<li><strong>LAG/LEAD</strong> 用于访问相邻行的数据，适合计算环比变化。</li>\n<li><strong>帧规范</strong>精确控制计算范围，ROWS 按物理行、RANGE 按值范围。</li>\n<li>使用 <strong>WINDOW</strong> 子句定义命名窗口，避免重复的窗口定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"窗口函数","id":"窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是窗口函数","id":"什么是窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"排名函数","id":"排名函数"},{"level":2,"text":"值访问函数","id":"值访问函数"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合窗口函数","id":"聚合窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"帧规范","id":"帧规范"},{"level":2,"text":"WINDOW 子句","id":"window-子句"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SQLite vs 客户端/服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/sqlite-vs-client-server"},"next":{"title":"CTE 与递归查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/cte-and-recursive"}}